a strong, flexible and crystal clear filament, as it will let 92% of visible light pass through its fibre.","source":"S-PET-TDS-Crystal-Flex","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q08305","text":"Because of its resilience and shore hardness of D63, Crystal Flex™ can be bend up to 230% without causing white stress marks after bending.","source":"S-PET-TDS-Crystal-Flex","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Surface finish","items":[{"id":"Q08293","text":"Excellent clarity","source":"R-FORMFUTURA-READER-20261004-47a4e58d606f","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q08294","text":"Very clear filament with 92% light transmittance and high surface gloss","source":"R-FORMFUTURA-READER-20261004-47a4e58d606f","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Adhesion between layers","items":[{"id":"Q08306","text":"An outstanding interlayer bonding completed with very limited water absorption and by that virtually no warping, make Crystal Flex™ a unique and wonderful material to print with.","source":"S-PET-TDS-Crystal-Flex","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Supports and removal","items":[{"id":"Q08299","text":"Compatible with Helios Support for complex multi-extrusion 3D printing","source":"R-FORMFUTURA-READER-20261004-47a4e58d606f","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]}]}],"layers":[],"published":[{"property":"Melt mass-flow rate","domain":"physical","unit":"g/10 min","products":1,"lo":7.5,"hi":7.5,"median":7.5,"values":[7.5]},{"property":"Vicat softening temperature","domain":"thermal","unit":"°C","products":1,"lo":82,"hi":82,"median":82,"values":[82]},{"property":"Water absorption","domain":"physical","unit":"%","products":1,"lo":0.09,"hi":0.09,"median":0.09,"values":[0.09]}],"environment":[],"guide":null,"resin":null,"sourc